cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ClaudeEssaySkill: measured writing guidance for ACM CHI and a calibrated prose verifier"
message: "If you use the measurements in data/, please cite this repository."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Two Claude Code skills forming a generator/verifier pair for academic manuscripts, with all
  quantitative guidance calibrated against a census of 4,011 ACM CHI main-conference papers
  (2024-2026) and a reference corpus of human-written academic prose. Includes the measured
  false-positive rate of an open-weights AI-text detector on pre-ChatGPT human papers.
keywords:
  - academic writing
  - ACM CHI
  - AI text detection
  - calibration
  - agent skills
license: CC-BY-4.0
